        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emihito ya Isirairi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka ogw'amakumi asatu na mukaaga ogw'engoma y'Asa, Baasa omukama wa Isirairi, nubwo yaramagiire Yuda, yagumya orubuga Rama nukwo atange abantu boona kuturuka rundi kutaaha bakahikaho omukama Asa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa, nubwo yakwasire efeeza n'ezaabbu ey'omu maahurro g'Enju ya MUKAMA n'eyomukikaali ky'omukama, yagitwekera Benihadadi omukama wa Siriya ow'akaba ali Damasiko naagamba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nyowe na iwe, tukole endagaano, nka isenyowe na Sso oku baakozire; nkutwekiire efeeza n'ezaabbu mbibyo; ogende ocwe endagaano yawe ei wakozire na Baasa omukama wa Isirairi, nukwo aihe amahe ge omunsi yange.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benihadadi yaikiriza omukama Asa eki yamugambiire, nukwo kutuma engabwa ez'amahe ge, barwanise, embuga za Isirairi, baasingura Iyooni, Daani, Abeeri-maimu, n'embuga eza Nafutaali zoona ez'amaahurro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Baasa obu yahuliire ekintu eki, yalekera aho kwombeka Rama yayemereza omulimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Asa nubwo yasoroize abasaija omunsi Yuda yoona, yabaragira kwetweka amabaale ga Rama n'embaaho zaayo, Baasa ebi akaba naayombekesa, baabinyaga, nibyo yayombekeseze Geba na Mizipa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hanani Omurangi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, Hanani omurangi, akahikaho Asa omukama wa Yuda yamugambira ati, “Habwokuba okeesiga omukama wa Siriya, tiwayesiga MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe; ihe ry'omukama wa Isirairi likutabukire ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyesopiya n'Abalibiya, bakaba bataina ihe erikooto mali, eriina ebigaali ebitarukubarwa n'abatembi b'embaraasi? Baitu habwokwesiga MUKAMA, akabakuha wabasingura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba, MUKAMA aikara naarora hanu na hali, okumara ensi yoona, nukwo ayoleke amaani ge, abo abanyakumweha n'omutima gwona. Kinu okakikoza obudoma; habweki, okuruga hati n'okweyongera omumaiso, amalemu tigaakuhwehoga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa nukwo kubiihirirwa omurangi, yamuboha n'enjegere yamuta omunju y'enkomo, habwokuba eki kikaleetera Asa kubiihirirwa muno omurangi. Kandi omu kasumi ako konyini, abantu abamu, nabo yabasaaliza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okuhwaho kw'engoma y'Asa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa ebi yakozire, okurugirra ha ky'okubanza okuhika ha kyokuherruka, bikahandiikwa omu Kitabu eky'obusinge bw'Abakama aba Yuda na Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa obwakaba yakamara ha ngoma emyaka amakumi asatu na mwenda, akakwatwa endwara yamuturuka omu bigere, kandi endwara ye, ekagenda neeyeyongera; kyonka n'omu ndwara ye egi, ataserre MUKAMA, baitu akagonza kukonyerwa abafumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa akafa nka baisenkuru; omu mwaka ogw'amakumi ana na gumu ogw'engoma ye nugwo yafeeriiremu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamuziika omu kituuro eki akaba ayebaiziire, omu rubuga rwa Daudi. Baamubyamya ha kitabu eki bakaba batairemu ebintu ebirukuboya ebitali bya mulingo gumu, ebyateekaniziibwe abakozi b'ebintu ebirukuboya; kandi habw'okumutamu ekitiinisa, baahemba omurro, gwamekukira haiguru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
